# REST API

### Get All Profiles
### curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Create New Profile
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo",
    "password": "1234",
    "mobile": "1234567890",
    "cardId": "1234567890123"
}

### Get some profile by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/f3356ffd-902c-4c92-911d-652051346aa9

